      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِرِّيَانٌ</span></b>  <i>A table upon which one eats;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِوَانٌ</span>:
(K:) or <i>a dish,</i> or <i>plate,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبَقٌ</span>,) <i>upon which food
is eaten.</i> (O.) [But see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِرِيَّانٌ</span>, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طرو</span>.]

